      "losning": "$f'(x) = 6x - 1$.\n$\\dfrac{3(x+h)^2 - (x+h) - (3x^2 - x)}{h} = \\dfrac{6xh + 3h^2 - h}{h} = 6x + 3h - 1 \\to 6x - 1$ då $h \\to 0$.",
